      <p>The platform ships as 13 Docker services orchestrated via <code>docker-compose.yml</code>:</p>
      <pre><code>docker-compose up -d          # Start all services
docker-compose ps              # Check status
docker-compose logs -f agent   # View agent logs
docker-compose down            # Stop all</code></pre>

