      <h1>System Architecture</h1>
      <p>The Agentic Platform is a containerised microservices system that runs 13 services on a single Docker bridge network (<code>platform-net</code>). Services are grouped into five architectural layers, each with a distinct responsibility. Every service is independently deployable and communicates over HTTP/gRPC within the internal network.</p>

      <div class="docs-callout info">
        <strong>Design Philosophy:</strong> Local-first, container-native, defence-in-depth. The entire platform boots with a single <code>docker-compose up -d</code> — no cloud accounts, no API keys, no build step. Cloud providers (Azure OpenAI, OpenAI, Azure AI Foundry) are optional drop-in replacements for the local Ollama default.
      </div>

      <h2>Platform Architecture</h2>
      <div class="docs-diagram docs-diagram-full">
        <div class="mermaid">
graph TD
    subgraph PRESENTATION["🖥️ Presentation Layer"]
        UI["<b>UI Console</b><br/>Express.js + EJS<br/>:3001 → :3000"]
        N8P["<b>n8n Proxy</b><br/>Nginx reverse proxy<br/>:8080 → :5679"]
    end

    subgraph APPLICATION["⚙️ Application Layer"]
        AGENT["<b>Agent Service</b><br/>FastAPI + LangGraph<br/>:8000 → :8010"]
        TOOLS["<b>Tools Service</b><br/>FastAPI sandbox<br/>:8001 → :8011"]
        N8N["<b>n8n</b><br/>Workflow engine<br/>:5678"]
    end

    subgraph INTELLIGENCE["🧠 Intelligence Layer"]
        OLLAMA["<b>Ollama</b><br/>Local LLM runtime<br/>:11434 → :11436"]
