    <!-- ── Principles ── -->
    <div id="doc-principles" class="docs-section">
      <div class="docs-breadcrumb"><a href="/docs">Docs</a> / Architecture</div>
      <h1>Architecture Principles</h1>
      <p>18 guiding principles for the Agentic Platform. Every design choice and ADR traces back to one or more of these principles. Principles are categorised by <strong>Enterprise Maturity Level</strong>.</p>

      <div class="docs-callout info">
        <strong>Maturity Levels:</strong>
        🟢 <strong>Current</strong> — implemented and validated today &nbsp;|&nbsp;
        🟡 <strong>Next</strong> — foundations exist, targeted for next cycle &nbsp;|&nbsp;
        🔴 <strong>Target</strong> — required for production enterprise deployment
      </div>

      <h2>Enterprise Maturity Model</h2>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0;margin-bottom:1.5rem">
        <div style="background:rgba(239,68,68,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.2);border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;padding:1rem 1.25rem">
          <strong style="color:#ef4444;font-size:0.78rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em">🔴 Target State (Production)</strong>
          <p style="margin:0.4rem 0 0;font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--text-2)">AP-11 Identity &amp; Access &nbsp;·&nbsp; AP-13 Elastic Scaling &nbsp;·&nbsp; AP-14 Compliance &amp; Governance &nbsp;·&nbsp; AP-15 Disaster Recovery &nbsp;·&nbsp; AP-16 Zero-Trust Networking &nbsp;·&nbsp; AP-17 Agent Lifecycle</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:rgba(245,158,11,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.2);border-top:none;padding:1rem 1.25rem">
          <strong style="color:#f59e0b;font-size:0.78rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em">🟡 Next State (Hardening)</strong>
          <p style="margin:0.4rem 0 0;font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--text-2)">AP-1 API Versioning &nbsp;·&nbsp; AP-5 Always-On Telemetry &nbsp;·&nbsp; AP-7 Full Service Split &nbsp;·&nbsp; AP-9 Complete Versions &nbsp;·&nbsp; AP-12 Cost &amp; Metering &nbsp;·&nbsp; AP-18 Secret Management</p>
